<h1 data-copy-en="Lily" data-copy-zh="Lily">Lily</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Unlock the bard and follow songs, dates and performance milestones." data-copy-zh="解锁吟游诗人，推进歌曲、约会与多场所演奏进度。">Unlock the bard and follow songs, dates and performance milestones.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unlocking_Lily_at_the_Guild"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Note_She_Won't_Resolve"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Note_She_Won.27t_Resolve"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="After_the_Applause"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Without_the_Song"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Encounter_with_Ryia"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Lily — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lily.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lily — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lily.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lily — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Lily’s route includes songs, dates and conversations. Bards Guild Clout and performances of the route’s own song at distinct venues matter alongside affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Unlock her portrait through six successful bard-discovery encounters across Dungeon and medieval alley exploration. Listening to the dungeon bard counts and fully restores Health, Energy and Calm. Successful duets also count; duets need composed songs and can fail.</p><p>After unlocking, she appears at Bards Guild, daily 13:00–23:59. Late heart-to-hearts start 21:00–23:59.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Story_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Performing_the_Route_Song_and_Building_Clout"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Route_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Return to the guild for the first scene, then follow the tables. The first date follows the first heart-to-heart, and the second date follows the second. Later scenes require Guild Clout and distinct-venue performances of her route song.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Echo Finds a Room</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Songs Without Endings</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); after The Echo Finds a Room; Bards Guild Clout 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A House With Two Names</th><td data-label="Location / start window">The Bar; 09:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Songs Without Endings / Lanterns Have Their Own Rhythm; Bards Guild Clout 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Rose and the Thorn</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after A House With Two Names; Bards Guild Clout 20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Both Names on the Page</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after The Rose and the Thorn / A Rest Between Notes; 3 distinct route-song venues; Bards Guild Clout 25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Where the Echo Returns</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Both Names on the Page; Bards Guild Clout 30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Place in the Refrain</th><td data-label="Location / start window">The Bar; 09:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after Where the Echo Returns; 4 distinct route-song venues; Bards Guild Clout 40</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Note She Won't Resolve</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); after Songs Without Endings; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 8 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">After the Applause</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after The Rose and the Thorn / A Note She Won't Resolve; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Without the Song</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after A Place in the Refrain / After the Applause; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Rose and the Thorn grants its own song, performable without Song Writing or Music Production. Its guild debut counts as one venue.</p><p>For the three-venue milestone, add two more venues; for four, use all four: Bards Guild, Performance Stage (06:00–20:59), Rowdy Alehouse (20:00–02:59) and the built Rose &amp; Thorn bar. Each performance costs 60 minutes and 30 Energy, once per day per venue across all songs. Repeating one venue or playing another song does not increase this route song’s distinct-venue count.</p><p>Extra song composition is separate: Music Studio in the present, 12:00–22:59, Song Writing, Music Production and Creativity 50; each attempt costs 30 minutes, $200 and 30 Energy. See the guild guide for Clout and performance rewards.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Lily</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Wine</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Wine</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lantern Rhythms</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after Songs Without Endings / A Note She Won't Resolve; 17:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $80; 30 Energy; restores 8 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Rest Between Notes</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after The Rose and the Thorn / After the Applause; 18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $50; 25 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk gives 1 base affection, four times per day. At Known (25), Wine gives 5 base affection once per day. Route songs, dates and conversations remain required.</p><p>Her favorite stats are Creativity, Charm, Communication. The learned Empathy skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>A failed duet does not count toward the six successful discoveries.</li><li>Check affection, Guild Clout and the preceding date or heart-to-heart for each scene.</li><li>Venue milestones count The Rose and the Thorn specifically, not another song.</li><li>Build the bar and use the stage and alehouse during their own performance hours.</li><li>The gifted route song does not need composition skills; extra original songs do.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-bards-guild.html">Songs and Clout</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Building the bar</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Music skills</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon encounters</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Unlocking_Lily_at_the_Guild"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Note_She_Won't_Resolve"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Note_She_Won.27t_Resolve"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-After_the_Applause"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Without_the_Song"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Encounter_with_Ryia"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Lily 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lily.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lily 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lily.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lily 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Lily的路线包括歌曲、约会与交谈。除了好感，吟游诗人公会声望及路线歌曲在不同场所的演奏记录也很重要。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>在地下城与中世纪后巷累计完成六次有效的吟游诗人发现遭遇，即可解锁头像。聆听地下城吟游诗人会计入次数，并回满生命、精力和镇定；成功合奏也算，但合奏需要已创作歌曲且可能失败。</p><p>解锁后每天13:00—23:59在吟游诗人公会出现，后期交心对话于21:00—23:59开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Story_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Performing_the_Route_Song_and_Building_Clout"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Route_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>回公会触发第一个事件，之后按表推进。第一次约会在第一次交心对话之后，第二次约会在第二次交心对话之后；后续还要求公会声望和路线歌曲的不同场所记录。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">回声有了归处</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有结尾的歌</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；完成：回声有了归处；吟游诗人公会声望10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个屋檐，两个名字</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">酒吧; 09:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：没有结尾的歌、灯笼自有节拍；吟游诗人公会声望15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">玫瑰与荆棘</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：一个屋檐，两个名字；吟游诗人公会声望20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">纸上的两个名字</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：玫瑰与荆棘、音符之间的休止；在3处不同场所演奏路线歌曲；吟游诗人公会声望25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">回声归来之地</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 13:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：纸上的两个名字；吟游诗人公会声望30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">副歌里的一席之地</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">酒吧; 09:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：回声归来之地；在4处不同场所演奏路线歌曲；吟游诗人公会声望40</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">她不肯落下的音符</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；完成：没有结尾的歌；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复8镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">掌声之后</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：玫瑰与荆棘、她不肯落下的音符；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不借歌声</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：副歌里的一席之地、掌声之后；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>玫瑰与荆棘直接给予对应歌曲，不必先学作词作曲或音乐制作即可演奏。公会首演算作一个场所。</p><p>三处门槛需再增加两处，四处门槛需完成全部四处：吟游诗人公会、表演舞台（06:00—20:59）、喧闹酒馆（20:00—02:59）和已建好的玫瑰与荆棘酒吧。每次60分钟、30精力，每处每天一次，所有歌曲共用次数。重复场所或改演其他歌曲，不会增加这首路线歌曲的不同场所数量。</p><p>额外创作歌曲要在现代音乐工作室12:00—22:59进行，要求作词作曲、音乐制作和创造力50，每次尝试30分钟、$200、30精力。声望与演奏奖励见公会指南。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Lily交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送葡萄酒</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；葡萄酒×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">灯笼的节拍</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：没有结尾的歌、她不肯落下的音符；17:00–21:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$80；30精力；恢复8镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">音符之间的休止</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：玫瑰与荆棘、掌声之后；18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$50；25精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈给予1基础好感，每天四次。已知（25）后每天可送一次葡萄酒，给予5基础好感，仍需完成路线歌曲、约会与对话。</p><p>她偏好的属性为创造力、魅力、沟通。学会共情可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>合奏失败不计入六次有效发现。</li><li>每一步都需检查好感、公会声望和前置约会或交心对话。</li><li>场所门槛必须演奏玫瑰与荆棘这首歌曲，其他歌曲不计入。</li><li>酒吧需建成，舞台和酒馆也有各自的演奏时段。</li><li>路线赠送歌曲不要求创作技能，自创额外歌曲才需要。</li></ul></section>
